#passage(("The Bible is a \"Biblios\": collection of different books, books written by who? Paul, whom we don't recognize at all, and other unknown people writing Scripture, as well as stories of Prophets written by unknown people again, and the first 5 books. What the Muslims say is the Injil is that which was given to Jesus himself, and he was preaching when he was walking. Even the Bible itself records it (Mathew4:23): \"Jesus went to Galilee and he preached the Gospel\". Which Gospel is he preaching? That's the gospel that we believe in. Not the gospel of Mark, Matthew, Luke, and John: the gospel of Jesus, the gospel that is given to Jesus by God directly, which he was teaching the people, not writings which were written later on, fabrications, lies and misattributions to him, mixed with some correct or Truthful statements. This idea to base the beliefs in the Bible and to compare them with Islam is inherently flawed.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Confronts Muslim On Quran Preservation! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HidefUs_Fak", ((393, "6:33–8:00"),), id: 4660)
