#passage(("In the previous Scriptures, there have been additions, there have been alterations, there have been twists in the Scripture. What we say is Allah sent Prophet Muhammad as the last and final Messenger, and He sent the Quran with him so he can bring us back to the Truth. Because those who change things in the other Scriptures, how would you know what is right and wrong? You wouldn't! So the Quran is a criterion for you. Whatever agrees with the Quran, then we know this is actually true, it happened. Whatever disagrees, we know that people have changed, manipulated these things, like there are evil things mentioned about Prophets in the Bible, for example in the Old Testament; we don't believe that. We believe Prophets are righteous people chosen by God. If they did all of these evil things, then no one would want to learn from them. Because why would I take them as an example and learn from them if they're doing evil themselves? But Prophets were the best among their people, and that's why what they taught was what people wanted to learn.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “English Student Becomes Muslim! Muhammed Ali - Speakers Corner”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vXu958o-hns", ((89, "1:29–2:16"),), id: 4720)
