#passage(("If something contradicts the Quran, revelation, and it comes from (not the Torah and Gospel, because you don't have the preserved Torah and Gospel anyways) what you call the Bible (we don't say that is the Torah and the Gospel), so if it comes from something that was corrupted and changed, which people refer to as the bible today, yes, we reject it. We don't even know who wrote this. Why would we accept something that goes against the revelation of God? And we don't even know who authored it. Why would we accept it?",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Suspicious \"Agnostic\" Attempts To Challenge Muslim! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d-cl2yFIzAs", ((31, "0:31–0:56"),), id: 4721)
