#passage(("The last objection that they present is that they say the Quran commands, many verses, the Christians and the Jews to follow their books, and there's no way it will command them to follow their books and their books are corrupted and not preserved and not authoritative. And they mention many verses. The first example of the verses they quote is chapter five of the Quran, verse 66 and 68, which say essentially the same thing: \"Oh people of the book, you have nothing to stand on unless you observe the Tawra and the gospel and that which has been revealed to you from your Lord. And your Lord's revelation to you, the Quran, will cause many of them to increase in wickedness and disbelief. So do not grieve about the people who disbelieve.\" All I did is read the verse. You could see the verse is explicitly telling you to follow the Quran, and how the Quran is going to make these people increase in wickedness. And subhan Allah, that's what we see. That is exactly what we see.", "That's why, what does he say explaining this verse? \"Say, oh Muhammad, to the Jews and the Christians: you are not upon anything that you claim you are upon, neither what Moses brought to you or Jesus brought to you, until you uphold the Tawra and the gospel and that which have been revealed to you from your Lord, that is what Prophet Muhammad brought you, the Quran, the criteria. So you act upon all of it and believe in all that it contains, so the belief of prophet Muhammad and his truthfulness, and acknowledge that all of it is from God. So do not deny any of it. Do not differentiate between the messengers of God, believing in some and disbelieving others. For disbelieving in one is like disbelieving in all, because the books confirm one another. So whoever denies one have denied them all.\" Nothing is clearer than this. So this verse is evidence against them.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “The Christian Dilemma: Do Muslims Believe The Bible Is Corrupted? Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.you