#passage(("Allah says, \"O people of the book, you're not upon anything until you establish the Torah and the Gospel.\" Doesn't say your book. Says the Torah and the Gospel, which we believe the original revelations given to Jesus and Moses. But then it says, \"And the Quran.\" So, what Christians do is take half of this verse and run away. You can't take half of the verse. The Quran says establish the Quran as well: believe in the Quran, follow the Quran, explicitly. In fact, Allah tells Prophet Muhammad explicitly in the Quran, chapter five, verse 48, and other verses, explicitly, that you can only judge the people of scriptures with the Quran. Do not judge with anything else other than the Quran. Our framework in the Quran is consistent.", "We believe the Torah and the Gospel which was revealed to Jesus and Moses mentioned the coming of Prophet Muhammad. So, you all can only establish them by believing in the Quran, because we believe they said that Prophet Muhammad is going to come and the Quran is going to be revealed. So, you cannot establish the Torah and the Gospel without believing in the Quran, without following Prophet Muhammad. Establishing them would mean to follow the tradition and the teachings in which they told you to follow the Prophet Muhammad in the Quran. That's what establishing them means. By the way, and this is something I'll say to any Christian: go open our exegesis of the Quran. Ibn Kathir, al-Tabari, all of them will tell you the same thing as I just told. Establishing here means to affirm that the Prophet Muhammad was sent the Quran, and follow his tradition. That's what establishing means. That's what we believe.", "The problem is the Christians know that their Bible is corrupted. So, what they try and do is they try and give validity to the Bible using the Quran. Which is hilarious, because, like I said, the Quran is clearly refuting beliefs that you believe in. Why do they do that? Because they know that if you look at it from an objective lens, the Bible is corrupted.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Becomes Speechless After Being Presented With The Christian Dilemma! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Z_W9m77uuyE", ((1308, "21:48–22:48"), (1396, "23:16–24:01"), (1449, "24:09–24:29"),), id: 4745)
